    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/25066f2aae7e9f8da5c7f594242880fd.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/25066f2aae7e9f8da5c7f594242880fd.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/25066f2aae7e9f8da5c7f594242880fd.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nengchi, can you hold yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prodigious cultivator from the Sect of Pure Retreat, Nengchi has long transcended worldly temptations. On the cusp of immortality yet stuck at his final bottleneck, he's forced to undertake a dangerous trial in &quot;Eden of Yao&quot;, a pleasure den teeming with seductive Yao.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through first-person perspective, you'll encounter a Immortal who takes delight in teasing you, a attractive girl who\u2019s only innocent on the outside, a bodyguard with personalities of contrast, a lethal assassin who\u2019s also alluring, and the Yao Queen who has karmic entanglement with you from past lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As these temptresses unleash their charms, can you hold your Chan mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules you better obey when in the Eden of Yao -</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ye Xiaoying</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Follow me... I'll tell you a secret.&quot; - Remember don\u2019t pry into her true identity, it\u2019s dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/c40c2cec07d417609d85efc32a4d9727.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/c40c2cec07d417609d85efc32a4d9727.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/c40c2cec07d417609d85efc32a4d9727.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/e5a3fdcd49cdd0f3305a2b7f59ed36be.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/e5a3fdcd49cdd0f3305a2b7f59ed36be.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/e5a3fdcd49cdd0f3305a2b7f59ed36be.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shushu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Let's just say... you look at it several times daily~&quot; - She\u2019s harmless in daily life, but never let her get to you. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/a0deba08c4a7c89774a5cfc6eac278fa.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/a0deba08c4a7c89774a5cfc6eac278fa.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/a0deba08c4a7c89774a5cfc6eac278fa.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/03254972fa9c91b9025a75d212b2832c.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/03254972fa9c91b9025a75d212b2832c.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/03254972fa9c91b9025a75d212b2832c.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lili</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;So... you wanna get punished?&quot; - It\u2019s okay to help her, but never mess with the things in her room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/016cd2cdc77106bc268ed26733b21808.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/016cd2cdc77106bc268ed26733b21808.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/016cd2cdc77106bc268ed26733b21808.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venerable Immortal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nengchi... are you sure your body can take this?&quot; - Your reliable guide, who wears multiple masks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/5131de0d534cb885cafd56be1dc69b2f.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/5131de0d534cb885cafd56be1dc69b2f.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/5131de0d534cb885cafd56be1dc69b2f.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yufen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mister, just play along with me.&quot; - Be on guard against her attacks, especially her kisses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who among them will eventually become an Immortal couple with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/6aef27dc15b3251ad68ec0ad162ef9db.poster.avif?t=1752984527\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/6aef27dc15b3251ad68ec0ad162ef9db.webm?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709650/extras/6aef27dc15b3251ad68ec0ad162ef9db.mp4?t=1752984527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u221aImmersive first-person perspective experience:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live-action + POV interactions, make every seduction in \u201cEden of Yao\u201d alarmingly tangible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u221aMulti-brunches storyline:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of options and over a hundred branches. Some of these branches are interwoven and can be switched at any time. A slip of thought may ruin your path to Immortal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u221aRich gameplay mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Album of Yao: Document each beauty's true form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freezing Spell: [Evil Grin]~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive gameplay: The bump of Cultivation Method... oh, yeah!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamland: How to choose among five?</p>",
